    a: "For a backyard or a patio, yes — that is what a 20W two-way unit is built for, and the woofer-tweeter split is why it stays clean at the volume you'll actually use instead of dissolving into crackle. For a parking lot or a block party, honestly, no single speaker at this price is, and the ones that come close cost $180 and weigh ten pounds. The better answer for a big space is two speakers spread apart, which is exactly what the 2-pack exists for — and a Boom+ pair still costs less than one Charge 6 at list.",
